{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/43890e1e528268159a284808c5ddd9f7.webp?t=1761439012\" width=776 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide a lone alien traveller through a mysterious world full of puzzles and challenges. Use forces of the cosmos, like gravity, wind, and solar energy, to guide your motion across the stars. Along the way, encounter quirky characters and unlock strange secrets pointing back to your forgotten past...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/3014556d6de72106cc3fc518e0698fdd.poster.avif?t=1761439012\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/3014556d6de72106cc3fc518e0698fdd.webm?t=1761439012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/3014556d6de72106cc3fc518e0698fdd.mp4?t=1761439012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/1b87347f9cbcc9ef11e8b1c7981eb33e.webp?t=1761439012\" width=776 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solaro blends open-ended exploration, cryptic puzzle-solving, and fast-paced trial challenges. Learn to use concepts from physics and astronomy intuitively, and devise original strategies to accomplish tasks in exotic planetary settings. The more you learn, the farther you'll travel, and the harder the challenges will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/00d33816efba6573b5c2996f886b4737.poster.avif?t=1761439012\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/00d33816efba6573b5c2996f886b4737.webm?t=1761439012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/00d33816efba6573b5c2996f886b4737.mp4?t=1761439012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/6a5d7376c4979f6e5c1852e0a25754e1.webp?t=1761439012\" width=776 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey through the world of Solaro will take you to epic gas giants, tiny dwarf planets, fiery lava worlds, frozen wastelands, and everything in between. A powerful protective shell lets you penetrate deep inside the deadliest and most extreme places in the universe...how far will you dare to venture?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/3490cdb771cc461ffa40b0709fecd053.webp?t=1761439012\" width=776 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solaro was designed by a solo developer and features innovative gameplay, beautiful, immersive environments, and a full original score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/a167ae5e87babbb0e93465dbd202dc25.webp?t=1761439012\" width=776 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ vibrant alien worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ unique &quot;orbital puzzles&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12+ hours of core gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12+ hours of optional features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ collectibles and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5 hours of original music </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1602740?t=1761439012","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/87cd48f6196a1a750d99a72843fda0e351b69231/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761439012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/d75bdb003b95b276f20e623b5cbf00c5c318258a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761439012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/d75bdb003b95b276f20e623b5cbf00c5c318258a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761439012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2801690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/43890e1e528268159a284808c5ddd9f7.webp?t=1761439012\" width=776 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide a lone alien traveller through a mysterious world full of puzzles and challenges. Use forces of the cosmos, like gravity, wind, and solar energy, to guide your motion across the stars. Along the way, encounter quirky characters and unlock strange secrets pointing back to your forgotten past...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph